# The crossed power follows sin^2(pi z / (2 L_c)).
# Reference: that law with the coupling length from the supermodes of the grid.
title Directional coupler cut at 0.75 of its coupling length
window width=14 length=15.25
guide straight x=-0.35 width=0.5 from=0 to=15.25
guide straight x=0.35 width=0.5 from=0 to=15.25
launch mode x=-0.35 width=0.5
monitor bar z=15.25 x=-0.35 width=0.5
monitor cross z=15.25 x=0.35 width=0.5
expect power bar 0.149724082 2e-7
expect power cross 0.849895891 2e-7
expect neff 2.632698756 2e-8
expect power cross 0.85355 0.02
expect sum bar cross 1.0 2e-3
